  "faq_attendance_q": "How do I view my child's attendance?",
  "faq_attendance_a": "You can click the Attendance tile on the home screen to view the monthly calendar marked with present (green), absent (red), and holiday (blue) days.",
  "faq_homework_q": "How do I check homework and class updates?",
  "faq_homework_a": "Go to the Class Update tile on the home dashboard. There you can toggle between homework and classwork logs and download worksheet templates.",
  "faq_chat_q": "How do I send a message to a teacher?",
  "faq_chat_a": "Click Talk to Teacher in the bottom navigation menu, choose the assigned teacher, and type your message in the chat box.",
  "faq_fees_q": "How do I pay school fees?",
  "faq_fees_a": "Click the Fees tile. If there is a pending fee, you can tap the payment button, select your payment method (UPI, Card, Net Banking), and verify the payment.",
  "faq_switcher_q": "How do I switch profiles for multiple children?",
  "faq_switcher_a": "Tap the child's name switcher chip at the top header of the home dashboard and select another child from the dropdown menu.",
